// War Bow. Epic sibling of the composite recurve: same D-stave in the hand
// frame, taller and thicker. Grip at the origin. Limbs along ±y with a −z
// belly (string toward the figure); tips fall back toward the y-axis.
// Staff stance keeps +y upright (chest-pelvis), not the wpnR down-swing.
